<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονῠχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pare the nails,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				996
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονυχίσασθαι τὰς χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.70
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>have them pared,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκριβῶς ἀπωνυχισμένος</span>
			<i>with</i> carefully <i>pared nails,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				26.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ σμίλης ἀπωνυχίσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					98.14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>scratch out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σιτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					709
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνυχίζω</span>
			 III, <i>polish by the nail,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ῥήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.77a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξονυχίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.59
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
